        <p>After payment, customers simply open the product to retrieve the scratch card, then scratch off the silver coating to get the lucky code. The lucky code can only be obtained after the customer purchases the product, retrieves the scratch card inside the product, and scratches off the silver coating on the scratch card.</p>
